.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026270/extras/5758b825bd6406a0e1827160d8bf7ece.poster.avif?t=1687224748\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026270/extras/5758b825bd6406a0e1827160d8bf7ece.webm?t=1687224748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026270/extras/5758b825bd6406a0e1827160d8bf7ece.mp4?t=1687224748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>Endless mode with global leaderboard and achievements<br></li><li>Three difficulty levels if you prefer a bigger challenge <br></li><li>Full Gamepad Compatibility<br></li><li>Full Steam Deck Compatibility</li></ul><br>Don't let the virus get the best of you, let's fight back!",
